      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "Sub-finding \u2014 DurableFile directory-fsync hole (Critical #1 root cause): DurableFile.AtomicWrite (DurableFile.cs:62-102) flushes the temp file (stream.Flush(flushToDisk:true)) and renames it over the destination (File.Move with overwrite:true), but never fsyncs the containing directory. The class self-documents this at lines 6-9. No FlushFileBuffers/fsync exists anywhere in src/. Every durable leaf (append journal, archive members, live artifact/sidecar, restore journal, config, bundles) funnels",
